Package: drop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), openssl
Recommends: nginx, certbot
Description: one-time file links behind nginx
 Share files through links that work once (or a set number of times) and
 expire. Tokens are stored as hashes; opening a link shows a page and only its
 button uses the link, so chat-app previews cannot burn it. Supports
 passphrases, a short retry window after broken downloads, end-to-end
 encrypted files decrypted in the browser, one-time upload links, and daily
 clean-up. nginx sends the files (X-Accel-Redirect).

Package: drop-share
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-cryptography, openssh-client, libnotify-bin
Recommends: qrencode, quickshell, xclip
Description: laptop client for drop (share)
 "share" uploads files to a drop server over ssh and prints links (end-to-end
 encrypted by default), manages links and upload requests, fetches received
 files, and runs a watcher that sends desktop notifications and feeds a status
 bar (polybar or Quickshell), and a panel (Quickshell) with the links, recent
 activity, received files and actions.
